{"seq":3,"slug":"image-management","title":"镜像管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/image-management","wordCount":1101,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"镜像管理\">镜像管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>镜像（Image）</strong> 由一系列只读层（Layer）按顺序叠加，每层通过 SHA256 内容寻址，因此相同基础镜像的容器共享底层只读层。容器运行时在镜像之上添加一个可写层（Copy-on-Write），运行时修改只落在这一层。</p>\n<p>在此之上有两个管理概念：<strong>标签（Tag）</strong> 是镜像的版本引用，可设计为可变（<code>latest</code>）或不可变（语义化版本、Git SHA）；<strong>镜像仓库（Registry）</strong> 负责镜像的存储与分发。三者共同决定部署的可追溯性、镜像体积与发布确定性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像分层存储\">镜像分层存储</h2><p>Docker 镜像由一系列只读层（Layer）按顺序叠加而成，每一层代表 Dockerfile 中的一条指令。容器运行时会在顶部添加一个可写层（Container Layer），所有运行时修改都发生在这一层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 镜像层结构&#10;        CL[可写层 Container Layer&lt;br/&gt;运行时修改]&#10;        L4[Layer 4: CMD 元数据]&#10;        L3[Layer 3: COPY 应用代码]&#10;        L2[Layer 2: RUN 安装依赖]&#10;        L1[Layer 1: FROM 基础镜像]&#10;        CL -.-&gt;|读写| L4&#10;        L4 --&gt;|只读| L3&#10;        L3 --&gt;|只读| L2&#10;        L2 --&gt;|只读| L1&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 镜像层结构\n        CL[可写层 Container Layer&lt;br/&gt;运行时修改]\n        L4[Layer 4: CMD 元数据]\n        L3[Layer 3: COPY 应用代码]\n        L2[Layer 2: RUN 安装依赖]\n        L1[Layer 1: FROM 基础镜像]\n        CL -.-&gt;|读写| L4\n        L4 --&gt;|只读| L3\n        L3 --&gt;|只读| L2\n        L2 --&gt;|只读| L1\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker image inspect nginx:alpine --format &#39;{{json .RootFS.Layers}}&#39; | jq .&#10;&#10;docker history nginx:alpine --format &quot;table {{.CreatedBy}}\\t{{.Size}}&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> inspect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:alpine</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{{json .RootFS.Layers}}'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:alpine</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"table {{.CreatedBy}}\\t{{.Size}}\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>镜像层</td>\n<td>Dockerfile 中每条指令产生的只读文件系统差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容器层</td>\n<td>容器运行时在镜像层之上的可写层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容寻址</td>\n<td>每层通过 SHA256 哈希唯一标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层共享</td>\n<td>相同基础镜像的容器共享底层只读层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Copy-on-Write</td>\n<td>修改文件时将文件从只读层复制到可写层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 镜像层的共享机制意味着，如果 10 个容器都基于同一个 <code>node:20-alpine</code> 基础镜像，磁盘上只需存储一份基础镜像层。这是容器比虚拟机更节省磁盘空间的关键原因之一。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"标签策略\">标签策略</h2><p>镜像标签（Tag）是镜像版本管理的核心。合理的标签策略能够保证部署的可追溯性和回滚能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker tag myapp:latest registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3&#10;docker tag myapp:latest registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2&#10;docker tag myapp:latest registry.example.com/team/myapp:1&#10;docker tag myapp:latest registry.example.com/team/myapp:latest&#10;docker tag myapp:latest registry.example.com/team/myapp:sha-a1b2c3d\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:sha-a1b2c3d</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标签类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语义化版本</td>\n<td>1.2.3</td>\n<td>精确指向特定版本</td>\n<td>生产部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主版本</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>自动获取最新次版本</td>\n<td>兼容性追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git SHA</td>\n<td>sha-a1b2c3d</td>\n<td>关联代码提交</td>\n<td>问题排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>latest</td>\n<td>latest</td>\n<td>默认标签，可变</td>\n<td>开发测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期标签</td>\n<td>20260401</td>\n<td>按构建日期标识</td>\n<td>每日构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境标签</td>\n<td>staging</td>\n<td>标识部署环境</td>\n<td>环境区分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 标签流转&#10;        DEV[dev 分支] --&gt;|CI 构建| SHA[sha-abc123]&#10;        SHA --&gt;|合并 main| SEM[v1.2.3]&#10;        SEM --&gt;|部署| PROD[production]&#10;        SEM --&gt;|回滚| PREV[v1.2.2]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 标签流转\n        DEV[dev 分支] --&gt;|CI 构建| SHA[sha-abc123]\n        SHA --&gt;|合并 main| SEM[v1.2.3]\n        SEM --&gt;|部署| PROD[production]\n        SEM --&gt;|回滚| PREV[v1.2.2]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在生产环境中<strong>永远不要</strong>使用 <code>latest</code> 标签部署。<code>latest</code> 是一个可变标签，不同时间 pull 可能得到不同的镜像内容，无法保证部署的确定性。始终使用精确的语义化版本或 Git SHA 标签。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像仓库\">镜像仓库</h2><p>镜像仓库（Registry）是存储和分发容器镜像的服务。根据安全和合规需求，可以选择公共仓库或私有仓库。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker login registry.example.com&#10;&#10;docker push registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3&#10;&#10;docker pull registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3&#10;&#10;docker manifest inspect registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> manifest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> inspect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仓库服务</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Docker Hub</td>\n<td>公共</td>\n<td>最大公共镜像仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub Container</td>\n<td>公共</td>\n<td>与 GitHub 深度集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS ECR</td>\n<td>私有</td>\n<td>IAM 权限控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Artifact</td>\n<td>私有</td>\n<td>GCP 生态集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Azure ACR</td>\n<td>私有</td>\n<td>Azure AD 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Harbor</td>\n<td>自建</td>\n<td>企业级安全策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 镜像分发流程&#10;        BUILD[CI 构建] --&gt;|push| REG[镜像仓库]&#10;        REG --&gt;|pull| STAGING[Staging 环境]&#10;        REG --&gt;|pull| PROD[Production 环境]&#10;        REG --&gt;|replicate| MIRROR[跨区域镜像]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 镜像分发流程\n        BUILD[CI 构建] --&gt;|push| REG[镜像仓库]\n        REG --&gt;|pull| STAGING[Staging 环境]\n        REG --&gt;|pull| PROD[Production 环境]\n        REG --&gt;|replicate| MIRROR[跨区域镜像]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像瘦身\">镜像瘦身</h2><p>镜像大小直接影响构建速度、传输时间和存储成本。系统化的瘦身策略能够将镜像从数百 MB 压缩到数十 MB。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker images --format &quot;table {{.Repository}}\\t{{.Tag}}\\t{{.Size}}&quot;&#10;&#10;docker system df&#10;&#10;dive registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> images</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"table {{.Repository}}\\t{{.Tag}}\\t{{.Size}}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> system</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> df</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dive</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/team/myapp:1.2.3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>瘦身前后对比示例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>优化前</th>\n<th>优化后</th>\n<th>节省</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>更换基础镜像 ubuntu→alpine</td>\n<td>78 MB</td>\n<td>7 MB</td>\n<td>91%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多阶段构建</td>\n<td>1.2 GB</td>\n<td>45 MB</td>\n<td>96%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理包管理缓存</td>\n<td>320 MB</td>\n<td>280 MB</td>\n<td>12%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并 RUN 指令</td>\n<td>150 MB</td>\n<td>120 MB</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 .dockerignore</td>\n<td>构建快 3x</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"FROM node:20-alpine AS deps&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./&#10;RUN corepack enable &amp;&amp; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --prod&#10;&#10;FROM node:20-alpine AS builder&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./&#10;RUN corepack enable &amp;&amp; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;COPY . .&#10;RUN pnpm build&#10;&#10;FROM node:20-alpine&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules&#10;COPY --from=builder /app/dist ./dist&#10;USER 1000:1000&#10;CMD [&quot;node&quot;, &quot;dist/index.js&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS deps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN corepack enable &#x26;&#x26; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --prod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS builder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN corepack enable &#x26;&#x26; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pnpm build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=builder /app/dist ./dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>USER 1000:1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"node\", \"dist/index.js\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像生命周期管理\">镜像生命周期管理</h2><p>随着持续构建，镜像仓库中会积累大量过期镜像。合理的生命周期策略保证存储成本可控。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker image prune -a --filter &quot;until=720h&quot;&#10;&#10;docker system prune --all --volumes&#10;&#10;docker images --filter &quot;dangling=true&quot; -q | xargs docker rmi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prune</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"until=720h\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> system</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prune</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --volumes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> images</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"dangling=true\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -q</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rmi</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管理策略</th>\n<th>实施方式</th>\n<th>推荐保留时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保留最新 N 个版本</td>\n<td>Registry GC 策略</td>\n<td>最近 10 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按时间清理</td>\n<td>删除超过 30 天的非生产镜像</td>\n<td>30 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按环境分级</td>\n<td>生产镜像保留更久</td>\n<td>90 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动化清理</td>\n<td>CI/CD 集成清理脚本</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 镜像生命周期&#10;        B[构建] --&gt; T[测试]&#10;        T --&gt; S[Staging]&#10;        S --&gt; P[Production]&#10;        P --&gt; A[归档]&#10;        A --&gt; D[删除]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 镜像生命周期\n        B[构建] --&gt; T[测试]\n        T --&gt; S[Staging]\n        S --&gt; P[Production]\n        P --&gt; A[归档]\n        A --&gt; D[删除]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((镜像管理))&#10;    分层存储&#10;      只读层叠加&#10;      可写容器层&#10;      Copy-on-Write&#10;      内容寻址&#10;    标签策略&#10;      语义化版本&#10;      Git SHA&#10;      避免 latest&#10;    镜像仓库&#10;      公共仓库&#10;      私有仓库&#10;      跨区域复制&#10;    镜像瘦身&#10;      Alpine 基础镜像&#10;      多阶段构建&#10;      清理缓存&#10;    生命周期&#10;      版本保留策略&#10;      自动化清理&#10;      分级管理\">mindmap\n  root((镜像管理))\n    分层存储\n      只读层叠加\n      可写容器层\n      Copy-on-Write\n      内容寻址\n    标签策略\n      语义化版本\n      Git SHA\n      避免 latest\n    镜像仓库\n      公共仓库\n      私有仓库\n      跨区域复制\n    镜像瘦身\n      Alpine 基础镜像\n      多阶段构建\n      清理缓存\n    生命周期\n      版本保留策略\n      自动化清理\n      分级管理</pre><ul>\n<li>Docker 镜像由只读层叠加而成，使用内容寻址（SHA256）实现层共享和去重。</li>\n<li><strong>标签策略</strong>应结合语义化版本和 Git SHA，生产环境禁止使用 <code>latest</code> 标签。</li>\n<li>镜像仓库选择取决于安全需求：公共项目用 Docker Hub / GHCR，企业内部用 ECR / Harbor。</li>\n<li>镜像瘦身的最大收益来自<strong>多阶段构建</strong>和<strong>更换轻量基础镜像</strong>，可节省 90% 以上体积。</li>\n<li>建立自动化的镜像生命周期管理策略，定期清理过期镜像以控制存储成本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"镜像管理","id":"镜像管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像分层存储","id":"镜像分层存储"},{"level":2,"text":"标签策略","id":"标签策略"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像仓库","id":"镜像仓库"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像瘦身","id":"镜像瘦身"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像生命周期管理","id":"镜像生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Dockerfile 最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/dockerfile-best-practices"},"next":{"title":"容器网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/container-networking"}}